msgid "Generic filesystem parameters"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man2/fsconfig.2:528
msgid ""
"Each filesystem driver is responsible for parsing most parameters specified "
"with B<fsconfig>(), meaning that individual filesystems may have very "
"different behavior when encountering parameters with the same name.  In "
"general, you should not assume that the behavior of B<fsconfig>()  when "
"specifying a parameter to one filesystem type will match the behavior of the "
"same parameter with a different filesystem type."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man2/fsconfig.2:535
