"がエラーを起こしたかを示す値に設定される。"

#. type: TP
#: build/C/man3/fts.3:199
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<FTS_NSOK>"
msgstr "B<FTS_NSOK>"

#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man3/fts.3:208
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "A file for which no B<stat>(2)  information was requested.  The contents "
#| "of the I<fts_statp> field are undefined."
msgid ""
"A file for which no [B<l>]B<stat>(2)  information was requested.  The "
"contents of the I<fts_statp> field are undefined."
msgstr ""
"B<stat>(2)  情報が要求されなかったファイル。 I<fts_statp> フィールドの内容は"
"定義されない。"

#. type: TP
#: build/C/man3/fts.3:208
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<FTS_SL>"
msgstr "B<FTS_SL>"

#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man3/fts.3:211
msgid "A symbolic link."
msgstr "シンボリックリンク。"

#. type: TP
