msgid ""
"If I<path> is an empty string, operate on the file referred to by I<dirfd> "
"(which may have been obtained from B<open>(2), B<fsmount>(2), or from "
"another B<open_tree>()  call).  In this case, I<dirfd> may refer to any type "
"of file, not just a directory.  If I<dirfd> is B<\\%AT_FDCWD>, "
"B<open_tree>()  will operate on the current working directory of the calling "
